  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed shopfront and rear extension, by reason of design and materials, would result in an incongruous and unsympathetic form of development that fails to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the surrounding Conservation Area and host Building of Townscape Merit. The scheme is therefore contrary to the NPPF (2024), the London Borough of Richmond upon Thames Local Plan (2025), in particular policies 28, 29, and 30, and the Supplementary Planning Document ‘Shopfronts’ (2010) as supported by the CA1 Barnes Green Conservation Area Statement."
